[BriefingSubmissions.STORM.attack_prk.assault_usa.Mission.Objectives]
Capture the inhabited locality in the mountain valley.

[BriefingSubmissions.ATTACK.attack_prk.defend_usa.Mission.Objectives]
Capture the inhabited locality in the mountain valley.

[BriefingSubmissions.ATTACK.attack_prk.defend_usa.Mission.Description]
Your combat team must infiltrate the mountain pass and capture an inhabited locality in the mountain valley which has been converted into a strong point by the enemy.

[BriefingSubmissions.STORM.attack_prk.assault_usa.Mission.Description]
Your combat team must infiltrate the mountain pass and capture the inhabited locality. It is located in a mountain valley, and has been converted into a strong point by the enemy. According to reconnaissance, the enemy will actively defend the position, and may even launch a counterattack.

[BriefingSubmissions.AI_STORM.assault_prk.attack_usa.Mission.Objectives]
Fend off the enemy attack. Do not allow the enemy to capture the inhabited locality.

[BriefingSubmissions.AI_STORM.assault_prk.attack_usa.Mission.Success]
Mission accomplished. Hostiles eliminated.

[BriefingSubmissions.AI_STORM.assault_prk.attack_usa.Mission.Failed]
Mission failed.

[BriefingSubmissions.AI_STORM.assault_prk.attack_usa.Mission.Description]
A small infantry team is defending an inhabited locality in the mountain valley from a possible enemy attack. The main body of your troops must fend off the enemy attack and prevent the hostiles from capturing the position.

[BriefingSubmissions.DEFEND.defend_prk.attack_usa.Mission.Objectives]
Repel all enemy attacks and prevent the hostiles from capturing the inhabited locality.

[BriefingSubmissions.SIEGE.defend_prk.attack_usa.Mission.Objectives]
Repel all enemy attacks and prevent the hostiles from capturing the inhabited locality.

