[BriefingSubmissions.ATTACK.attack_usa.defend_prk.Mission.Objectives]
Capture the inhabited locality.

[BriefingSubmissions.ATTACK.attack_usa.defend_prk.Mission.Description]
Your combat team must infiltrate the mountain pass, and capture an inhabited locality in the valley which has been fortified by the enemy.

[BriefingSubmissions.STORM.attack_usa.assault_prk.Mission.Objectives]
Capture the inhabited locality.

[BriefingSubmissions.STORM.attack_usa.assault_prk.Mission.Description]
Your advance party must quick-march to the area marked on the map and capture the inhabited locality before the enemy vanguard arrives. Quickly eliminate any possible hostiles and secure the location. Then, quickly prepare to repel the attack of the enemy's main forces.

[BriefingSubmissions.DEFEND.defend_usa.attack_prk.Mission.Objectives]
Repel all enemy attacks and prevent the hostiles from capturing the inhabited locality.

