[BriefingSubmissions.AI_STORM.assault_usa.attack_prk.Mission.Objectives]
Hold the inhabited locality for the specified time.

[BriefingSubmissions.AI_STORM.assault_usa.attack_prk.Mission.Description]
An enemy advance party plans to launch an off-the-march attack on a tactical inhabited locality. Hold the locality for the specified time until our main forces arrive.

